MISATTRIBUTED QUOTATIONS ARE ~100% HERE BY DESIGN and are not an instrument
failure: they are the manipulation, counted under the name the pre-registered
check gives them. On M1 the same column is the instrument failure it has always
been.

`ruling_line_mismatch` strict counts rulings whose prose contradicts their line;
conservative counts a reader's NEITHER as a mismatch, which is what
metrics.json prints. jd3's M1 measured 1.2% / 4.7%.

