====================================================================================================
(0) is the pre-registered manipulation check and it is the only threshold in
this phase. (a), (b), (d), (e) and (f) are descriptive; (c) is an ABLATION and
never an endpoint; (g) is POST HOC. The mechanism behind (a)'s 10.2% is not in
any index: it is eleven rulings read by hand in HANDCHECK-fabricated.md, which
finds the judge verifying the RECORD quotation and never asking whether the
judgment contains the sentence attributed to it.
